<p>A German court has issued a temporary injunction ordering the country’s domestic intelligence agency to stop publicly calling the Alternative for Germany (AfD) “extremist” while the dispute over the label plays out. The broader case isn’t over, but the ruling immediately limits what the agency can say publicly about the party until a final decision. AfD leaders welcomed the injunction, with co-leader Alice Weidel calling it a “major victory”.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/lItCbdTUJe5gIzxHk1SkixKls4D1v0Oi_gZ_ykYLH41nrN38ozc_zFLlR6Ndjj2vRUugmcxXG4u5WvpPXSTFWUhvSwXKVFPRsmTYX-MKfJn29SNDKx4Xpv2bEPgHHZFfxwfOBVnU2xw_sFWw4EyyRVa956py41pRhj8rmVcdCbkS0RfYEcY9GZI2Yacazxjulu-eBQ' alt='Supporters of Alternative für Deutschland, or AfD, in Halle, Germany, last year.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Scope of the order: The injunction focuses on the language the agency uses in public. It does not settle the underlying dispute over the designation.</li><li>Timing: The court granted the injunction on Feb 26, and it takes effect immediately while the case continues.</li><li>Public impact: The New York Times described the ruling as a symbolic victory that may not change many Germans’ views of the party.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Alternative for Germany (AfD): Co-leader Alice Weidel celebrated the injunction publicly, calling it a significant win even as the case continues. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/clyg10ek7r7o'>BBC</a>)</li><li>German domestic intelligence agency: The agency can keep monitoring the AfD, but it must temporarily stop using the “extremist” label in public. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/26/world/europe/germany-ruling-afd-extremist.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/26/world/europe/germany-ruling-afd-extremist.html'>German Intelligence Must Temporarily Halt an Extremist Label for the AfD, Court Rules</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/clyg10ek7r7o'>AfD hails court injunction on &#x27;extremist&#x27; label as victory</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/german-intelligence-must-pause-extremist-label-for-afd/a-76140587'>German intelligence must pause extremist label for AfD</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/german-court-grants-injunction-to-afd-party-suspending-extremist-classification-by-spy-agency'>German court grants injunction to AfD party, suspending &#x27;extremist&#x27; label by spy agency</a> - straitstimes.com</li></ul>